      explanation: '<Teleport to="body"> renders its children into another DOM node while keeping them in the component\'s LOGICAL tree: props, injection, and event bubbling to the Vue parent all still work. Only the physical DOM location changes — escaping z-index/overflow/transform traps.',
      realWorldExample: 'A modal inside a deeply nested, transformed card: without Teleport, the card\'s transform creates a containing block that breaks position:fixed. Teleport to body fixes it without restructuring.',
