      explanation: 'defineAsyncComponent(() => import("./Heavy.vue")) lazy-loads a component as a separate chunk, with options for loadingComponent, errorComponent, delay, timeout. <Suspense> handles a different async axis: components whose setup() is async (top-level await) — it renders #fallback until all awaited setups in the subtree resolve, then swaps in #default atomically.',
