      explanation: 'Pinia stores are singletons of reactive state + computed getters + plain-function actions, created in effect scopes. No mutations layer (Proxy reactivity tracks direct writes), flat stores instead of nested namespaced modules, and full TS inference. storeToRefs extracts state/getters as linked refs for destructuring; actions destructure directly.',
