      explanation: 'Keys give the differ identity. With stable unique keys, Vue matches old↔new children by key and moves DOM nodes minimally (LIS-based). Without keys (or with index keys) Vue patches in place by position: when you insert/remove/reorder, component state and uncontrolled DOM state (focus, input value, KeepAlive cache) stay at the old POSITION while data shifts underneath.',
